WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:07.040
Six months into America's COVID-19 pandemic cases are surging, small businesses are faltering,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.880
playgrounds are empty, and unemployment is at 11%.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:17.140
Our best hope for ending this nightmare is a vaccine and there are more than 165 in development.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:21.180
But when a vaccine becomes available how many Americans will refuse it?

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.100
Bill Gates vaccine is magically ready,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.640
but in order to get the vaccine you also have to receive the biometric tattoo.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.660
Will you take it?

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.840
I don't trust the vaccines, I never did.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.700
And be able to force things into your body that then slowly debilitate you with binary weapon systems

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.400
and kill you.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:44.220
Vaccines are the greatest healthcare advance of our time preventing an estimated 4.5 billion infections

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.940
since their advent.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.200
So what explains the reluctance of so many Americans to vaccinate?

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:56.040
It's a combination of bad science the government's long history of misleading the public and the collapse

00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:01.060
of confidence in public health authorities because of their catastrophic failures in response

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.060
to the COVID-19 pandemic.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:08.700
But if the government responds by attempting to force Americans to take a COVID-19 vaccine

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.320
it will only help the conspiracy theorists.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:17.060
Public health officials can begin to undo the damage of the past six months by rejecting authoritarian

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:22.880
and paternalistic approaches in favor of careful persuasion and brutal honesty

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:25.560
about the limits of their own knowledge.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:31.160
Though most Americans surveyed say they'll probably take the vaccine there's a real possibility

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:37.280
that a sizable block of refusers could allow this Novel Coronavirus to continue spreading

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.759
based on what's happened with measles,
and vaccine refusal tends to happen

00:01:41.759 --> 00:01:45.360
in clusters according to researcher Tara C. Smith.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.280
2019 was the worst measles year in a
generation when you have some of these

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:53.200
groups of individuals where vaccination
rates are low

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.079
it just takes one person with measles to
get in there and spread it through a

00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:59.119
community
vaccine skeptics often focus on the

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:02.960
claim that
childhood vaccines cause autism i think

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.439
they
need to wake up and stop hurting our

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:09.520
kids the vaccines
are dangerous if not given a dangerous

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.840
to certain people who are more
susceptible

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.120
two years old two and a half years old a
child a beautiful child

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.400
went to have the vaccine and came back
and

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.239
a week later got a tremendous fever got
very very sick

00:02:22.239 --> 00:02:27.360
now is autistic the claim famously was
amplified by a british researcher named

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.760
andrew wakefield i started getting calls
from parents who said

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.519
my child was developing perfectly
normally and then they had their mmr

00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:37.920
vaccine
in many cases and then they just

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.400
disappeared his 1998 paper linking
vaccines and autism

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:47.280
was later retracted and the uk general
medical council found him guilty of

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.800
multiple ethics violations for lying
about his test subjects

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:55.599
and failing to disclose a financial link
to an anti-vaccine lawsuit

00:02:55.599 --> 00:02:59.440
but concern about vaccines is rising
among parents

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:03.040
along with objections to the use of
mercury preservatives

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.200
which both haven't been proven to do
harm and haven't been present in

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:12.640
childhood vaccines for nearly 20 years
an ecosystem of anti-vaccine information

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.159
has emerged and according to the
american journal of public health

00:03:16.159 --> 00:03:20.560
bots and paid russian trolls participate
in online vaccine debates

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:24.720
far more than the average social media
user and the trolls don't always join

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.519
the anti-vaccine side of the debate
but aim to elevate the visibility to

00:03:29.519 --> 00:03:34.159
create false equivalency
eroding public consensus on vaccination

00:03:34.159 --> 00:03:37.360
you have some people that
really don't know what to think so you

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.920
know we think of them as kind of fence
sitters

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.519
and they're really just trying to figure
out you know what is going on what do i

00:03:43.519 --> 00:03:47.440
believe what do i trust
largely those people in the middle are

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:51.440
the ones that that i try to reach
but u.s public health authorities have

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.959
sometimes misled the public about
vaccines and other public health

00:03:54.959 --> 00:03:57.439
interventions
which has made the job of convincing

00:03:57.439 --> 00:04:00.959
skeptics more difficult
the united states government did

00:04:00.959 --> 00:04:07.760
something that was wrong
deeply profoundly morally

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:12.799
wrong the tuskegee experiment so
deep distrust of the government and

00:04:12.799 --> 00:04:16.320
public health particularly in black
american communities

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.120
in 1932 government doctors recruited
mostly poor black sharecroppers at the

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:25.199
tuskegee institute
for a study of the impact of syphilis

00:04:25.199 --> 00:04:28.639
the participants
the majority of whom had the disease

00:04:28.639 --> 00:04:32.400
were told they were getting an
experimental medicine when in fact they

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.320
were all given a placebo
scientists running the study were

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.520
actually interested in the progression
of the illness when left

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.639
untreated the experiment continued until
well

00:04:42.639 --> 00:04:46.160
after penicillin became available in
1947

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:51.040
and many participants died they were
lied to

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:56.320
by their government another incident
that damaged trust in public health

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:00.720
occurred in 1976
when a novel virus called the swine flu

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:04.639
broke out at a u.s army base
and scientists believe that it bore a

00:05:04.639 --> 00:05:09.360
genetic similarity to the 1918 flu
that had killed more than 100 million

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.600
people worldwide
offer every american the opportunity to

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:18.720
be inoculated
against a swine type influenza virus

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:22.960
president gerald ford authorized 135
million dollars to develop

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:27.520
and deploy a vaccine and the government
injected 25 percent of americans in a

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:31.600
10-month period
but the global pandemic never came the

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.199
disease died out
and the rushed version of the vaccine

00:05:35.199 --> 00:05:39.120
likely resulted in some
injuries though probably not as many as

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:44.160
reported by the media at the time
smith says more humility is called for

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:48.560
in public health communication it's hard
but i think we have to emphasize that

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.440
uncertainty
and i think that may have been one thing

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:54.800
missing with the masks and i was
probably guilty of it myself you do not

